@startuml
' SEQUENCE DIAGRAM D — Skenario Pelacakan Pengiriman (Tracking)
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
title **Sequence Diagram — Pelacakan Pengiriman**

actor "Anggota\n(Pembeli)"          as U
participant "App Flutter\n(Frontend)"      as App
participant "OrderApiController"     as C
participant "Shipment\n(Model)"      as S
database "Database\n(MySQL)"         as DB
actor "Ekspedisi /\nKurir"           as K

autonumber
U -> App : Buka detail pesanan, pilih "Lacak"
App -> C : GET /api/orders/{id}/track
C -> S   : getByOrder(order_id)
S -> DB  : SELECT * FROM shipments WHERE order_id = ?
DB --> S : data resi & status
S --> C  : objek Shipment
C --> App: HTTP 200 OK (status, posisi, ETA)
App --> U: Tampilkan peta & status pengiriman

note over S, K
  Status pengiriman (dikemas -> dikirim ->
  transit -> sampai) diperbarui oleh
  Ekspedisi/Kurir melalui endpoint terpisah.
end note

K -> C   : POST /api/shipments/{id}/status
C -> S   : updateStatus(status)
S -> DB  : UPDATE shipments SET status = ?

caption Gambar 3.8 Sequence Diagram Pelacakan Pengiriman
footer Sequence Diagram — SmartMart | Modul Pengguna & Dashboard | Tugas Akhir
@enduml
